description: "\"guarantees[5]: Explainable Reasoning,Evidence-Based Decisions,Memory Integration,Reproducible Inference,Traceable Engineering Thought\""
spec:
  id: reasoning_graphs
  version: 1.0.0
  status: stable
  priority: critical
  module: Cognition
  compiler_stage: Reasoning
  description: "\"\\\"Defines the Universal Reasoning Graph (URG), the executable representation of engineering reasoning. A Reasoning Graph models how an engineer transforms evidence into validated engineering knowledge through interconnected reasoning paths.\\\"\""
purpose: Represent reasoning as graph execution rather than linear inference.
ekr: Every Engineering Knowledge Record references one or more Reasoning Graphs.
success: Every engineering reasoning process is represented as a reusable graph.
future:
  graph_execution_engine: true
  probabilistic_reasoning: true
  graph_embeddings: true
  autonomous_reasoning: true
  self_improving_reasoning: true
